'''Frosty''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.
== Spawning ==
'''Frosty''' can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. It requires {{Skill|fishing|1}} to be fished up. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Frosty''' is {{Green|2875}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|28.75%|1|3.48|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there's no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

