== Strategy ==
It can be difficult to kill Frosty due to the {{stat|knockback}} and high fire rate from its weapon. A {{Item|Slime Hat}}, {{Item|Dwarf Turtle Shelmet}} or {{Item|Shellwise Shard}} is recommended to prevent {{stat|knockback}}. The recommended way to kill it is to use a [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]] or [[Swords]] due to [[Sea Creatures]] being immune to arrows from most bows.

